# Bot2 bolts Bot1 (an instant in a graveyard), Bot1 Duresses Bot2 (a sorcery), and Bot2 discards a Mountain to hand size
# (a land), so Barrowgoyf is a 3/4. It attacks on turn 7 unblocked, deals 3 with lifelink, and its trigger mills that
# many: an Island, a Guerrilla Gorilla and a Swamp. Bot1 takes the Gorilla, the only creature card among them, into its hand.

